---
const photo = "https://www.figma.com/api/mcp/asset/185ac42d-bea8-4984-937b-73da1dcc0725.png";
---

<!-- Reversed 2-col: photo left, text right -->
<section class="py-20 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 items-stretch">

    <!-- Left: photo -->
    <div class="h-64 sm:h-80 md:h-auto min-h-0 order-1">
      <img
        src={photo}
        alt="Book Editing"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Right: text -->
    <div
      class="bg-[rgba(217,217,217,0.1)] flex flex-col justify-center px-6 sm:px-8 md:px-10 py-10 sm:py-12 order-2"
    >
      <h2 class="font-bold text-xl sm:text-2xl uppercase leading-snug text-black mb-3 sm:mb-4">
        HEARST Book Studio A Leading Book Editing Company
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[#555] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting
        industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry's standard dummy text ever
        since 1966 when designers at Letraset and James Mosley, the librarian at
        St Bride Printing Library in London.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[#555] text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Took a 1914 Cicero translation and scrambled it to make dummy text for
        Letraset's Body Type sheets took a 1914 Cicero translation. Lorem Ipsum
        is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem
        Ipsum has been the industry's standard dummy text ever since 1966 when
        designers.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Full-width centered paragraph -->
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-10">
  <p class="text-[#555] text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
    Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.
    Lorem Ipsum has been the industry's standard dummy text ever since 1966,
    when designers at Letraset and James Mosley, the librarian at St Bride
    Printing Library in London, took a 1914 Cicero translation. Lorem Ipsum is
    simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has
    been the industry's standard dummy text ever since 1966, when designers at
    Letraset and James Mosley, the librarian at St Bride Printing Library in
    London, took a 1914 Cicero translation.
  </p>
</div>
